SY_TALK("WrA0zanUOj8",[[932,["It was very nice to come to Reading again,","and to meet very nice people like your Mayor"]],[942,["and another nice person who was interviewing","me at the radio station."]],[950,["I am discovering new talents in this place","which is really historically very important."]],[961,["But in the history of spirituality, England","as a whole has to play a very, very important"]],[970,["role, which perhaps English people don’t","realise."]],[973,["William Blake has said that, that England","has to become Jerusalem."]],[979,["It has to become a Holy land and you all have","to become holy people."]],[985,["He is not a liar, he wouldn’t tell you a","lie."]],[989,["People can say that he was a visionary and","he visualised things beyond his foresight."]],[996,["That’s not a fact, because about Sahaja","Yoga he has written very vividly, clearly,"]],[1005,["as to where I’ll be staying since my arrival","in England, where our ashram is going to be."]],[1013,["It is so beautifully done that I feel this","land has something special about it to produce,"]],[1023,["or to create, such great poets, such great","seers."]],[1029,["India of course is a country of yoga, no doubt."]],[1034,["But there also we had a great poet, about","the same time as Blake, maybe a little earlier,"]],[1043,["Gyaneshwara."]],[1044,["He did write about Kundalini."]],[1045,["He also described the times of Sahaja Yoga","by saying that: at that time, the people who"]],[1054,["are in darkness, the people who are blind,","will see light."]],[1063,["He’s also gone further to say that: those","people who will receive light, will be able"]],[1071,["to enlighten other people."]],[1075,["But William Blake has very clearly said that","men of God will become prophets, and these"]],[1083,["prophets will have powers to make others prophets."]],[1088,["And this is the test that you should put to","everything: “Have I become a prophet?”"]],[1098,["I mean, it’s all right there are many people","who are around, who are selling their things."]],[1103,["I don’t know what they are doing to attract","more people."]],[1107,["Like the mayor asked me that, “As your work","is so fantastic, you must have been receiving"]],[1118,["thousands of people!”"]],[1120,["I said, “No I don’t."]],[1123,["Sometimes I receive five or sometimes ten!”"]],[1125,["He was amazed!"]],[1126,["He said, “How can that be?”"]],[1128,["I said, “It’s true!"]],[1130,["I receive very few people to come to my programme."]],[1132,["And if they come and stick on for a while,","they get Realisation all right."]],[1138,["But there are very few who come."]],[1139,["He was quite amazed."]],[1141,["He said, “Really?"]],[1142,["But I am surprised, you don’t charge any","money, there’s no membership."]],[1146,["I mean it really shows that it is something","Divine."]],[1150,["And still, how is it few people come to you?”"]],[1153,["I said, “I will ask the same question to","you, because I don’t understand human beings!"]],[1158,["You better answer me that why so few people","come and take advantage of this Sahaja Yoga"]],[1165,["which gives you the power that is lying within","you, which gives you what you have already"]],[1173,["existing within you, which is your own, it’s","your own property."]],[1179,["Still they don’t come, even if you tell","them [that] freely you are going to be given"]],[1182,["all your bank balances, please come, please","come, but they don’t come.\""]],[1187,["So I said, “Instead of asking me this question,","for the first time, let me ask you this question."]],[1192,["I can’t understand.\""]],[1194,["But in Indian villages it’s a different","thing: where the people come in thousands."]],[1200,["One of the reasons may be that the people","do not know much about Kundalini, they are"]],[1204,["naïve about that."]],[1206,["And they do not know what it means by the","word ‘Self-Realisation’: what it means,"]],[1213,["what is a Self, and what should happen to","us."]],[1216,["Perhaps that may be the reason: a sort of","ignorance about it."]],[1223,["But despite all that, this word ‘Self-Realisation’","has been used since long by many marketeers,"]],[1230,["and nobody has been able to give it."]],[1232,["Now if somebody says, “Yes it can happen","to you, just it can happen.\""]],[1238,["I think there should be real interest."]],[1240,["But still I cannot explain why is it that","few people come, and those who come also do"]],[1250,["not stick on, they have no patience."]],[1252,["“But with other gurus?”"]],[1254,["He asked me."]],[1256,["I said, “No, there are many [that] go: thousands","and thousands.\""]],[1261,["There’s one fellow whom the British people","have given 58 Rolls Royces, and then they"]],[1268,["gave him a 59th one because he would not come","without getting a Rolls Royce from them."]],[1273,["So they starved themselves for one year, and","gave him the 59th Rolls Royce!"]],[1278,["And how many people must have done it?"]],[1281,["Fifty-thousand people collected that money","to give it to this fellow to come down here!"]],[1286,["Already now that he has 59th, I think he must","be waiting for the 60th."]],[1290,["And I wouldn’t be surprised that they will","be again collecting money for him."]],[1296,["One must understand that you cannot pay for","God."]],[1300,["You cannot buy God by giving him a Rolls Royce."]],[1304,["He doesn’t understand this Rolls Royce,","He doesn’t understand money, He doesn’t"]],[1308,["understand bank."]],[1309,["He doesn’t know the mint."]],[1310,["He doesn’t know that you are having a new","system, of this paper money."]],[1317,["He’s not aware of these things."]],[1320,["But somehow we are so much used to these mundane","things, regular things, that we personally,"]],[1327,["all of us, feel that if it is going to be","God, He has to be just like us: there should"]],[1332,["be an organisation, there should be a chairman,","there should be a vice-chairman, there has"]],[1337,["to be a secretary, and all this organisation","must be there."]],[1341,["And there only if we go, then it’s all right,","then we are safe, we are secure, because we"]],[1345,["are used to it."]],[1348,["But God’s laws and God’s domain is very","different from what we understand."]],[1354,["We have never felt his love."]],[1357,["We have been always working, with all our","organised things because we were insecure"]],[1363,["about something."]],[1364,["Every institution is for some kind of an insecurity."]],[1368,["Because we are insecure, we think something","is going to fall upon us, something horrible"]],[1374,["is going to happen, that’s how we form a","thing."]],[1378,["Otherwise our children may be spoiled or our","old people may die, or something may happen,"]],[1384,["we form an organisation."]],[1386,["This is not believing in God."]],[1389,["Secondly we form, also, organisations because","we hate."]],[1394,["But we have never seen the Power of Love,","which is the most beautiful, blissful and"]],[1401,["smoothly working: like a flower becoming a","fruit."]],[1407,["Have you ever seen a flower becoming a fruit?"]],[1409,["Nobody has seen it."]],[1410,["How slowly it becomes!"]],[1414,["Have you ever seen a bud opening into a flower?"]],[1418,["You have to put a slow motion camera to catch","that slow movement."]],[1422,["All that is done by this great Power of God,","this Divine Power which is called as ‘Brahma’"]],[1429,["in Sanskrit language."]],[1431,["And to know that Brahma is the idea behind","Self-Realisation."]],[1438,["It is all-pervading, It is working everywhere,","but we cannot feel It and we have to feel"]],[1444,["That."]],[1445,["And how to feel it?"]],[1447,["How to know that?"]],[1448,["The only way is to get yourself connected","with your Self which connects you to that"]],[1454,["All-pervading Power, and it starts flowing","through you."]],[1457,["If you learn the ways and methods you can","manoeuvre it, you can use it and you can give"]],[1465,["it to others also."]],[1466,["It’s a very simple thing like putting a","connection."]],[1471,["Like you come in the room: if you have to","put on the lights, you just have to switch"]],[1476,["on, it’s like that."]],[1478,["It’s very simple."]],[1479,["But when you switch on the light, you must","know that there’s a very huge organisation"]],[1485,["behind this little switch."]],[1487,["In the same way, behind all this there’s","a very great organisation of God Almighty,"]],[1492,["which we have not known: we have just heard","about God, “There is God, and let’s pray"]],[1497,["to God,” All that."]],[1498,["But where is He?"]],[1500,["What is He?"]],[1501,["And what are we?"]],[1502,["We have never known that."]],[1503,["So first time you get connected with His Power."]],[1510,["Now about Spirit: I mean, in English language","‘spirit’ is used for so many things!"]],[1516,["They will use it for a dead body – it’s","a spirit."]],[1521,["They’ll use it for also spirits: alcohols."]],[1523,["‘Spirit’ for Atma."]],[1525,["But where I am talking now it is about the","Atma: the Spirit, which is the reflection"]],[1531,["of God Almighty within us, which is the witness,","which watches every moment, every action of"]],[1539,["ours."]],[1540,["And it stays there till it enjoys."]],[1542,["To understand the Spirit, we have to know","its nature, what is the nature of the Spirit"]],[1551,["is, and then, when we get enlightenment, what","happens to us."]],[1557,["Now here you have seen three powers, as they","have shown you."]],[1560,["The first power is on the right hand side,","is the power of action."]],[1565,["I mean the first one is the power of desire","which is on the left hand side, the second"]],[1571,["one is the power of action, and in the centre","is the power of, what we call, the sustenance"]],[1577,["which gives you our evolution."]],[1579,["So we have three powers."]],[1583,["All these three powers act within us."]],[1586,["For example the first power of desire."]],[1588,["The first power of desire within us acts in","such a manner that we start desiring for things."]],[1598,["Actually the whole universe is created [and]","out of the universe, this beautiful thing"]],[1604,["like human being is created."]],[1607,["And this power that has created this special","thing called ‘human being’ is the residual"]],[1617,["power that resides in the triangular bone,","for the ultimate desire to be one with the"]],[1628,["Divine."]],[1630,["But it has not yet manifested, so that is","why it is called as a residual power."]],[1633,["It has not yet manifested because we have","not yet become one with the Divine."]],[1639,["So that power is still sleeping within us,","that’s why they call it a sleeping Kundalini."]],[1644,["But that desire is within us, and that drives","us to all kinds of seeking: we make mistakes,"]],[1650,["we do all kinds of wrong choices — doesn’t","matter — everything can be forgiven."]],[1657,["But she resides in the triangular bone waiting","for a chance when she could be awakened by"]],[1666,["somebody who has the authority to awaken."]],[1668,["As he told you just now that it’s an actualisation,","you cannot just go to a church, and somebody"]],[1673,["puts the hand on your head and he says, “All","right, I have baptised you.\""]],[1676,["This is only just a false certificate, you","know that."]],[1678,["It’s a false certificate."]],[1680,["But when this power is manifested, when you","become one with the Divine, when yoga, the"]],[1688,["union, takes place, then only we can say that","Kundalini has manifested itself: means your"]],[1695,["desire to be one with the Divine has been","manifested."]],[1699,["So now there are four powers I have told you","about: one is the power of desire with which"]],[1707,["we desire other things."]],[1710,["Like we may desire to have a chair."]],[1714,["So what we do, if there is some steel which","is dead, we make another dead stuff like called"]],[1720,["a ‘chair’, which is of steel — another","dead."]],[1722,["We sit on it [and] we start become habituated","with this: means a part of us is deadened,"]],[1729,["because we can’t sit without a chair, the","chair sits on our head."]],[1733,["People carry chairs with them, because they","just can’t sit without the chairs."]],[1736,["Like that the matter starts fighting your","Spirit, and starts giving you habits."]],[1741,["The another thing of matter is that it never","gives you joy."]],[1746,["For example, you want to have a table, all","right, then you want to have a chair, then"]],[1751,["you want to have a car, then you want to have","a helicopter, and never happy!"]],[1755,["So, wants in general are never satiable; is","a principle of economics."]],[1762,["Why?"]],[1763,["Because matter cannot give you satisfaction,","that’s why."]],[1766,["It just plays with you."]],[1768,["You like one thing, you jump to it, you like","another thing, you jump to another one."]],[1773,["Now this matter within us is created by the","right side, that is the power that comes to"]],[1780,["us from five elements."]],[1782,["And these five elements, when they are not","enlightened do not give joy."]],[1790,["They are within us, we use them."]],[1794,["Supposing somebody thinks that, “If I go","to race and if I win a big amount of money"]],[1799,["I’ll be happy.\""]],[1800,["But you go and see the person after six months,","you will find that he’s the most unhappy"]],[1804,["person ever known."]],[1805,["Because money is a headache, house is a headache."]],[1808,["Anything that you own is a headache."]],[1810,["It is better that others should own it and","you should enjoy; that’s a better way of"]],[1814,["looking at things."]],[1815,["But we think that possession is something","that we can really enjoy, which is not true,"]],[1822,["because we are not going to take anything","with us."]],[1825,["Now when these five elements act upon us,","what happens to us?"]],[1832,["What do we develop?"]],[1834,["We develop, in the subtle way, the attention."]],[1837,["Say there is something, a matter, here, my","attention can be drawn to it."]],[1842,["If there is something material, my attention","can be drawn to it."]],[1846,["But supposing something is in the ether, I","cannot see it."]],[1849,["Something that is not material I cannot see","it."]],[1852,["So the attention cannot be drawn."]],[1854,["That’s how our attention is created by these","five elements, within ourselves."]],[1860,["Now this attention that we have: naturally","because it is created by the material things,"]],[1866,["in the sense that it is created by the causal","of these elements, our attention goes to material"]],[1874,["things."]],[1875,["It’s natural, because it is created by that,","isn’t it?"]],[1876,["Our attention is outside."]],[1877,["If I say, “Put your attention inside!”"]],[1879,["How can you?"]],[1880,["I mean there’s no way of putting it inside:","it’s an impossible situation."]],[1886,["Because anything that happens outside, our","attention goes there."]],[1890,["Something material, something substantial","we see, and then our attention goes to that."]],[1896,["But how can you put your attention inside,","because we are lost, we do not know where"]],[1899,["to go, how to find it, how to put our attention","inside."]],[1902,["So this attention is within us, and when the","Kundalini rises, then the attention is drawn"]],[1910,["in, because of the happening."]],[1911,["That’s why a happening is necessary."]],[1913,["Supposing suddenly you are listening to me,","and something falls down, your attention will"]],[1919,["go to it."]],[1920,["That is why a happening takes place, that","this Kundalini rises and she attracts the"]],[1924,["attention inside."]],[1925,["But actually when she touches the Spirit,","what happens to the attention itself?"]],[1931,["The attention becomes enlightened."]],[1934,["Now what is that?"]],[1937,["Attention becomes enlightened, means what?"]],[1940,["Means that this attention has a light."]],[1944,["Now supposing you have an attention which","has a light, what should happen?"]],[1950,["That you look at anyone, you should be able","to know that person in and out."]],[1953,["That should be the first thing, isn’t it?"]],[1955,["If your attention has the light, you should","be able to see through that person just like"]],[1959,["an x-ray you should know where the problem","is."]],[1962,["Then, if your attention is enlightened, you","should be able to help that person also, with"]],[1967,["your attention, by paying [attention]."]],[1969,["Enlightenment is the enlightenment by the","Divine Power of love."]],[1976,["So if you pay attention to somebody, that","love must act."]],[1982,["Otherwise it is just like any other attention:","You pay attention to this, nothing happens."]],[1986,["You pay attention to that, nothing happens."]],[1988,["You pay attention to anyone, nothing happens."]],[1991,["But when you are enlightened, then your attention","is enlightened."]],[1995,["And you will find, after Sahaja Yoga, if you","pay attention to someone, you can cure that"]],[2000,["person."]],[2001,["If you have reached a certain stage of maturity","in Sahaj Yog."]],[2007,["Like there was one of the first Sahaja yogis","in England who got his Realisation, who is"]],[2013,["here I think."]],[2015,["He was a little doubtful."]],[2016,["And he said, “Mother you said that our attention","gets enlightened: how are we to know about"]],[2021,["other people?”"]],[2022,["I said, “Very easy!"]],[2023,["About whom do you want to know?”"]],[2024,["He said, “I want to know about my father.\""]],[2025,["I said, “All right.\""]],[2026,["His father was in Scotland."]],[2028,["“You put your hands and think of your father."]],[2031,["Just think.\""]],[2032,["He started a burning here."]],[2034,["Now these are the centres for your father","(right hand) and these are the centres for"]],[2038,["your mother (left hand)."]],[2039,["And this started burning."]],[2041,["Now this finger denotes this centre (Vishuddhi)."]],[2043,["So I told him he must be down with very bad","bronchitis."]],[2051,["He said, “How can there be telecommunication?”"]],[2053,["This is enlightenment, into a new world of","telecommunication!"]],[2058,["I said, “All right you ring up your father!”"]],[2060,["He rang up his father."]],[2061,["And the father never came to the phone."]],[2065,["And his mother said, “Your father is down","with very bad bronchitis.\""]],[2073,["Now sitting down here you can give cure to","that."]],[2076,["Now it’s not a cock and bull story, I must","tell you."]],[2080,["It is so fantastic, that people can’t believe","it."]],[2084,["But you can."]],[2085,["But you have to have certain maturity to do","that."]],[2088,["If your light is a little hazy, then it doesn’t","work out."]],[2091,["I mean, you can cure people, sitting down","here, sitting down in London: I should say,"]],[2097,["most humbly I can cure them; I have done it."]],[2101,["And some other people have done it also."]],[2104,["So what happens is that the attention which","goes there…Now for example, our attention"]],[2109,["is dead in a way."]],[2110,["If it goes there, what happens?"]],[2111,["Only thoughts start coming to us."]],[2113,["On the contrary this [thought] is more dominating","[to us] than ourselves."]],[2115,["Because as soon as we look at something, some","thought starts coming."]],[2118,["I mean, you can’t look at anything without","some thoughts coming into your head."]],[2121,["I mean, imagine the domination of the matter","on us, that everything gives us a thought!"]],[2126,["While, when you look at a thing, when you","are a realised-soul, then this attention acts."]],[2131,["If it is a living thing, you can see the action","working on that."]],[2138,["But if it is dead, then what happens?"]],[2141,["Then you become thoughtless."]],[2143,["Say you see a beautiful painting, you see","a beautiful painting: now there is no thought"]],[2151,["in your mind; so all the creation of that","painting just starts pouring in you as joy."]],[2157,["You feel that joy just pouring into you, because","there is no thought in between."]],[2162,["Otherwise normally we’ll think, “Who has","painted this picture?”"]],[2165,["“Who has done this?”"]],[2166,["How much they must have paid?”"]],[2167,["That’s the first thing!"]],[2168,["First question would be how much money it","must have cost!"]],[2171,["Then second would be, “Who is the artist?”"]],[2173,["All these questions actually paralyse the","beauty, the art, the creation of that painting."]],[2183,["Like [on] a wave-free surface of some lake,","you can see the complete image, the reflection,"]],[2193,["of the surroundings of that lake."]],[2197,["The complete creation, the complete joy comes","to us."]],[2199,["In the same way you become absolutely thoughtless."]],[2202,["You see something and you become absolutely","thoughtless, because the joy is so complete,"]],[2208,["that you just get stunned and the whole thing","starts pouring into you, like showers of joy."]],[2215,["It’s an experience which you cannot have","before Realisation."]],[2218,["It’s only possible after Realisation: that","you can enjoy your attention."]],[2224,["And it is such a joker."]],[2226,["Your attention plays tricks and tells you","so many things about other people."]],[2231,["Like, I was coming and I said, “Now let","us see."]],[2236,["This gentleman, I have to meet him."]],[2238,["Let me see his vibrations.\""]],[2240,["I said, “Now."]],[2241,["His vibrations: this is catching.\""]],[2243,["All right, what does that mean?"]],[2244,["A problem with his wife: either he has no","wife, or if he has a wife, it’s a wrong"]],[2251,["relationship, or maybe there’s a problem","with the wife."]],[2252,["This is wife’s [centre]."]],[2256,["And we discovered it was so."]],[2258,["But because I knew about it, I didn’t touch","that point."]],[2260,["Because if you say that, you will have it!"]],[2262,["So better not say that point."]],[2263,["You know already about the gentleman, what","sort of a problem he has, so better not touch"]],[2267,["that point and gradually try to remove it."]],[2270,["Like that, it is so easy, after Realisation,","to know about others."]],[2275,["Like a gentleman came to see me, he was an","Indian and he knew that a person who is a"]],[2282,["seeker is not supposed to drink, when you","come at least to a holy person."]],[2286,["But he gave up his drinking: for about eight","days he did not drink, he had a bath everything;"]],[2291,["he had a nice mouthwash with everything and","he came and saw me."]],[2295,["And I said, “You have to give up your alcohol","completely.\""]],[2297,["He said, “Mother how do you know this?”"]],[2301,["I said, “I know!”"]],[2303,["Because the centres that are catching in him","are only possible if you are a drunkard."]],[2307,["And I said, “You have been a drunkard, and","that is why it has been there.\""]],[2311,["He agreed that, “I was."]],[2313,["But eight days back I gave it up."]],[2315,["I said, “Eight days makes no difference!"]],[2317,["I know that you have been a drunkard, and","you’ll have to give up that gradually.\""]],[2320,["He said, “I will Mother, I promise you.\""]],[2323,["But this is really surprised him: how did","I know about it?"]],[2326,["So much so that once a lady came to see me,","and I found that her right hand here, was"]],[2334,["completely charring, and this was all catching."]],[2339,["So I asked her, “What is your relationship","with your father?”"]],[2343,["Especially this finger."]],[2344,["“Oh,” she said, “what has it to do with","it?”."]],[2348,["Normally girls in India are very attached","to their fathers and, it’s a very good relationship."]],[2353,["I said, “There must be something wrong,","otherwise you can’t get such horrible feelings"]],[2358,["about it.\""]],[2359,["“Yes but how do you know Mother?”"]],[2360,["I said, “I know, you better tell me.\""]],[2361,["“Oh, it’s all right, it’s all right."]],[2363,["We have a good relationship, nothing wrong,","this, that.\""]],[2365,["I said, “Really?”"]],[2366,["She said, “Yes, we have no [problem]."]],[2368,["I mean, it’s perfectly all right!”"]],[2370,["And she went away."]],[2371,["I was wondering; I knew she was telling me","lies."]],[2375,["Just after that, her mother came in, and her","father and they said, “Oh that was our daughter"]],[2380,["who had come to see you.\""]],[2381,["I said, “Really?”"]],[2382,["He said, “Do you know this girl has filed","a [law] suit against me, her father?”"]],[2389,["“Really?”"]],[2390,["“Yes!"]],[2391,["And on wrong basis."]],[2392,["Under the advice of a very wrong person."]],[2394,["Her husband is abroad, and some wrong person","has put ideas into her head, and she has filed"]],[2397,["a suit against me.\""]],[2402,["“Aaaah!”"]],[2404,["I said, “See!"]],[2405,["That’s what happened!”"]],[2406,["So the attention gives you all the information:","when it is enlightened."]],[2408,["It corrects the problems."]],[2411,["And of all the things it warns you, it warns","you beforehand."]],[2418,["For a Sahaja Yogi, supposing a Sahaja Yogi","is misled, he loses the way, then it is accepted"]],[2423,["that we have to go that way, there is something","we have to do."]],[2426,["And just he goes that way and he finds the","thing that he has lost for a long time, or"]],[2430,["he meets a friend whom he has to meet or some","address that he had, he gets it."]],[2434,["We don’t mind getting lost or anything because","you find that this was necessary to go that"]],[2441,["way to find something."]],[2443,["It’s so interesting and so interwoven."]],[2444,["And sometimes you start understanding, after","some time, that there are angels who are looking"]],[2450,["after you."]],[2451,["Definitely there are angels who are guiding","us."]],[2455,["Every moment, they are there, and taking our","attention to things which are important."]],[2462,["Because of Spirit’s quality, to be collectively","conscious, our attention itself becomes collectively"]],[2468,["conscious."]],[2469,["The priorities change."]],[2472,["The priorities change so much."]],[2476,["Like I was going in Kashmir one day, in a","car, and suddenly I told my husband, that"]],[2484,["there is tremendous vibrations in this place."]],[2488,["So he asked the driver: he said, “Is there","any temple here?”"]],[2492,["He said, “No, it’s a wilderness."]],[2494,["There is no temple, nothing!”"]],[2496,["I said, “About two, three miles maybe."]],[2498,["Let’s go ahead.\""]],[2499,["So he said, “No there’s some muslims staying","here."]],[2500,["There’s no temple, no question of having","a temple.\""]],[2503,["I said, “Is there a mosque?”"]],[2505,["“Oh,” he said, “Yes."]],[2506,["There is a mosque of Hazratbal!”"]],[2509,["One hair of Mohammed Sahib is kept in that","mosque."]],[2514,["And I felt the vibrations at least four, five","miles away from it!"]],[2518,["Just imagine!"]],[2519,["And when we came about three miles, I could","just tell him how to go there."]],[2522,["And only one hair was emitting [so many] vibrations."]],[2525,["So the whole priority, the attention, goes","to things which have good, Divine vibrations."]],[2530,["It is not bothered about things which have","no good vibrations."]],[2534,["Whatever has good vibrations, it will go to","that."]],[2537,["Like a person who is a holy person, he touches","anything, it vibrates."]],[2541,["He touches water, it vibrates."]],[2544,["Anything you touch, anything you feel, it","vibrates it."]],[2548,["For example, water, if you vibrate it, it","can be a medicine."]],[2553,["River Ganges is nothing but vibrated water!"]],[2556,["You get vibrations from that."]],[2558,["These vibrations are Divine vibrations, are","the vibrations of the power of love of God."]],[2565,["It is something so much out of the blue, that","suddenly if you hear about these things, it"]],[2570,["sounds quite odd and fantastic But it is not","at all to Indians, they know about all it."]],[2576,["This knowledge has not come to us."]],[2579,["But in the Bible, Christ has said that, “Your","hands will speak.\""]],[2583,["Your hands will speak: that means in your","hands you will be feeling it."]],[2588,["He said it very clearly."]],[2590,["Your hands will speak: that is what should","happen to us."]],[2593,["That our hands should speak, means they should","communicate to us what they have to communicate."]],[2599,["Because all the centres are represented in","our hand."]],[2602,["As shown there you can see all the centres","are on the left hand side and right hand side,"]],[2607,["you can see very clearly how these centres","are denoted on our hand."]],[2612,["And once you start feeling them, if you know","the decoding of it, you can immediately say"]],[2616,["what the other person is suffering from, what","you are suffering from."]],[2621,["And then you have to learn how to correct","them, those problems of the another person."]],[2627,["So the first thing that happens to you [is]","that your attention becomes enlightened."]],[2633,["This attention is so wonderful, is so joy-giving,","it’s so humorous, because you become like"]],[2645,["a witness; the whole thing becomes a joke."]],[2647,["You see people seriously running up and down","to do something, and you just don’t understand."]],[2653,["And you ask them, “What’s the matter with","you?”"]],[2657,["“Oh, you don’t know?"]],[2658,["It’s very important, very important!”"]],[2659,["“Yes what?”"]],[2660,["“I have put all my money for the race.\""]],[2661,["And he comes back, head hung!"]],[2666,["“What happened?”"]],[2667,["“I lost all my money!”"]],[2670,["The way he was running, the way he is coming","back, is a big joke."]],[2671,["But to him it’s not: he becomes serious,","sometimes he becomes involved into in, sometimes"]],[2676,["elated, but you are just enjoying the whole","joke."]],[2679,["The whole tragedy and comedy of life you enjoy,","like a spectator."]],[2684,["You become the spectator: you are no more","worried, upset or in tension."]],[2689,["Actually I have seen people who are very hot","tempered become so placid and so sweet and"]],[2695,["so poised."]],[2696,["It’s surprising how they change, because","they have got the balancing point, the absolute"]],[2701,["point."]],[2702,["This is what happens to your attention when","you get Realisation."]],[2705,["But then what happens to your awareness, which","you get from the central path of your evolution?"]],[2711,["For example animals have an awareness."]],[2716,["Also we have an awareness."]],[2718,["We have awareness much higher than that of","animals."]],[2722,["Some people say, “Yes we can play tennis,","you see.\""]],[2725,["that’s a higher awareness than animals."]],[2729,["But some people cannot play tennis or understand","it."]],[2731,["But one awareness human beings have, definitely","— whatever they may be, at whatever level"]],[2737,["— that they understand what is dirty, what","is filthy."]],[2741,["They can smell it; animals can’t."]],[2743,["You take a horse or a dog through a dirty","length, it will just walk like a king, as"]],[2750,["if it’s leading a parade for the queen — it","has no problems."]],[2754,["But for human beings we just can’t do it!"]],[2756,["We have to put something to cover our nose."]],[2759,["So, like that, we have many other things which","we have achieved as human beings."]],[2765,["We have sense of colour, we have sense of","beauty, we have sense of balance."]],[2768,["We have so many things, which dogs may not","have, horses may not have, dolphins may not"]],[2775,["have."]],[2776,["They are so close to us — they live with","us — but they may not have those senses"]],[2780,["as we have."]],[2781,["But now, what happens to human awareness,","at this stage, is that this human awareness"]],[2787,["suddenly jumps up into a new dimension."]],[2789,["You become collectively conscious."]],[2791,["You become!"]],[2792,["Again, I say."]],[2793,["It’s an actualisation: it happens to your","awareness."]],[2798,["You just become collectively conscious."]],[2801,["Means, little children, today Olympia, she","was interviewing me, she came and she put"]],[2809,["her fingers in her ears, because the lady","who was talking to me had a problem in her"]],[2814,["throat."]],[2816,["Perhaps maybe she has to use her throat too","much also, or maybe something else."]],[2820,["So she put her fingers in her ears."]],[2821,["You see, this is the mantra we use “Allah","hu akbar” by putting fingers."]],[2825,["The little one, she is very small, about two","years of age, she just put in."]],[2828,["But still she felt she has not helped me fully,","so she put both her fingers in the mouth to"]],[2835,["suggest that please look after the lady, she’s","got this problem."]],[2839,["The concern and the feeling that you get for","another person is so tremendous, so tremendous,"]],[2846,["that people can’t understand but it’s","very simple [to explain], because if you become"]],[2851,["part and parcel of the person, how can you","not have concern?"]],[2854,["I mean who is the other?"]],[2856,["The problem is [that] now, supposing you are","sitting before me, and you have a problem"]],[2860,["in your stomach, I’ll also have a little","problem."]],[2863,["And I’ll be so concerned about that problem","that it is as if in my stomach that problem"]],[2867,["is existing."]],[2868,["It is like that."]],[2870,["The awareness becomes so collectively conscious","that it becomes part and parcel of you."]],[2874,["Who is the other?"]],[2875,["The feeling of otherness goes away."]],[2878,["Now people talk big things like, “We are","all united,” “We are all brothers and"]],[2881,["sisters, and this and this.\""]],[2884,["You must have heard all these speeches."]],[2885,["And when it comes to war, they’ll fight."]],[2888,["But in this, you cannot fight, because who","is the other?"]],[2891,["You can’t fight your nose."]],[2892,["You can’t fight your hand."]],[2893,["You can’t fight your fingers."]],[2894,["Nor do you help anyone."]],[2896,["You don’t help anyone."]],[2897,["Because supposing this finger is in trouble","and this hand presses it, does it help it?"]],[2902,["Nothing!"]],[2903,["This is neither obliged, nor this is helping."]],[2905,["This is one."]],[2906,["That feeling of oneness — that you are part","and parcel of the whole is — established."]],[2912,["Because of that feeling, that is such a tremendous","feeling that you are part and parcel of the"]],[2917,["whole, that you get cured."]],[2920,["The curing comes because of that innate understanding","by your being, that you are not alone: you"]],[2930,["are part and parcel of the whole, you are","a cell of the whole body of God, or you are"]],[2938,["a microcosm of the macrocosm."]],[2940,["This is not just a psychological or a rational","thing, but you just become."]],[2946,["You just become, you can’t help it."]],[2949,["And when you are that, you just don’t feel","you are helping anyone."]],[2953,["It’s just like one cell acting for another","cell."]],[2956,["The whole thing works in such a homogeneous","way: no fighting, no quarrelling."]],[2960,["On the contrary, you enjoy each other!"]],[2964,["You just love each other."]],[2966,["And you just see the good points of another","person."]],[2968,["You don’t see the bad points."]],[2969,["You forget the race, you forget all creeds,","and everything you forget."]],[2974,["Because a nose doesn’t say, “I am higher","than the hands!”"]],[2977,["Does it say?"]],[2978,["Or the feet do not say, “I am lower than","the hands!”"]],[2980,["They all are required."]],[2981,["Supposing there is something wrong with the","feet, you will just try to help."]],[2985,["Something wrong with the nose, you’ll help","your nose."]],[2987,["You don’t discriminate in your body, do","you?"]],[2989,["In the same way, we do not discriminate."]],[2992,["Once you become realised-souls, whether you","are from India or from Asia, or from any other"]],[2997,["place, from England, America, any place you","may be."]],[3000,["You may be Chinese: every sort of faces that","we have, in the cross section of Sahaja Yogis!"]],[3005,["You will find all kinds of people are there,","and they all love each other."]],[3009,["You must see the way when these people from","England went to India, to the villages where"]],[3014,["I worked: the villagers just grabbed them!"]],[3016,["And they were so happy: they said, “First","time we are meeting our brothers and sisters!”"]],[3022,["And these people were just enjoying them,","and they all started dancing."]],[3025,["Of course they are very light-footed and they","wanted all these people to dance with them."]],[3029,["And though the Britishers are not so light-footed","as they are, so they found it rather difficult."]],[3034,["So they made them jump, jump, jump!"]],[3036,["And now they have become good dancers too;","and they all dance together and sing together,"]],[3040,["in complete joy and understanding."]],[3043,["The whole attitude towards life changes."]],[3046,["You become really a princess in the sense","that you don’t need anything — there is"]],[3051,["no dearth."]],[3052,["If there is a dearth then you are beggar."]],[3055,["If there is no dearth, you can sleep here,","you can sleep in a palace."]],[3058,["If you want you can get a Rolls Royce or if","you want, you can walk."]],[3062,["What’s the harm?"]],[3064,["What’s the difference?"]],[3065,["Because the joy comes from your Spirit, not","from outside things."]],[3069,["The whole idea of comfort changes."]],[3071,["The whole idea of luxury changes."]],[3074,["It’s all completely changed because you","enter into this new dimension."]],[3079,["And that’s what happens to your awareness:","that you become collectively conscious."]],[3083,["The enlightenment gives a human awareness","a new dimension by which you are collectively"]],[3090,["conscious."]],[3091,["Now emotion gives us happiness: if you love","somebody you feel happy, and [if] you meet"]],[3097,["that person you feel happy."]],[3099,["And you want to bestow all your love on that","person."]],[3102,["If your children are there, you want to love","them, and give them love."]],[3106,["But before Realisation, this joy is limited."]],[3110,["For example, husband wife relation I can understand."]],[3113,["But about children, like in India: they love","their children so much that they will even"]],[3117,["sell their country for their children’s","sake."]],[3120,["The love becomes like a possession."]],[3122,["It becomes a love hate relationship."]],[3125,["They love so much that they come to hatred."]],[3127,["It’s a funny thing but it happens."]],[3130,["Why?"]],[3131,["Because it has limitations."]],[3133,["Love has limitations: it’s not infinite."]],[3137,["But when you get your love enlightened you","get joy."]],[3142,["There’s no material given thing, just you","enjoy each other."]],[3149,["In Calcutta first time on my way to America","I had gone."]],[3152,["I was staying in a hotel and there were five","or six other Sahaja Yogis staying with me,"]],[3156,["in other rooms."]],[3157,["And one gentleman came to see me, and he fell","at my feet, and tremendous vibrations he had."]],[3163,["And they all rushed: “Who has come?"]],[3166,["Who has come?”"]],[3167,["I said, “Why?”"]],[3169,["“Tremendous joy started flowing on our head,","Mother!"]],[3171,["Who is at your feet?”"]],[3172,["They all rushed to me."]],[3173,["I said, “See this one.\""]],[3176,["“Haahh!”"]],[3177,["They all stood, ‘Haahh!"]],[3180,["What enjoyment!"]],[3181,["What enjoyment!”"]],[3182,["He was enjoying."]],[3183,["They were enjoying him."]],[3184,["This is the first time you enjoy human beings."]],[3185,["Because you can feel the vibrations of a person."]],[3189,["What a beauty [a] human being is, what a glory","he is, what a blessing he is, what a creation"]],[3195,["he is, you realise only after Realisation."]],[3198,["Before that, you judge him — “Oh he has","got long hair,” “He has got red hair,”"]],[3204,["“He has got long nose” — All that."]],[3208,["But then you just see him in a subtle way."]],[3210,["What he is, is his vibrations."]],[3213,["And so many people I have seen — Sahaja","Yogis also — if they get somebody they’ll"]],[3216,["all rush there."]],[3217,["The fellow is there, and they are all taking","vibrations, for half an hour and I am tired."]],[3221,["I say, “Now finish it off!”"]],[3223,["But no they are just sucking it like a child."]],[3228,["First time you enjoy human beings — the","joy which has not duality."]],[3235,["Joy does not have happiness and unhappiness."]],[3239,["Happiness comes to us when our ego is pampered."]],[3242,["Unhappiness comes to us when our ego is damped."]],[3246,["It is something different."]],[3247,["We are not our egos, we are our Self."]],[3251,["And when Self enjoys something, it enjoys","it."]],[3254,["There is no remorse, there is no duality about","it, there is no unhappiness."]],[3260,["So joy is a complete thing."]],[3263,["It cannot be described."]],[3264,["It is just to be experienced, and enjoyed","within ourselves."]],[3267,["And that’s what happens to us."]],[3269,["When we get our Realisation our idea of love","changes."]],[3275,["Like, you say, “Oh I love this person only.\""]],[3279,["Like your husband is there, you have to love","him like a husband."]],[3283,["You don’t love everybody like a husband."]],[3285,["Your sister is there, you love her like a","sister."]],[3288,["But you think all others as your sisters."]],[3291,["Then you love your brothers; you think them","to be your brothers."]],[3293,["You love all of them."]],[3296,["The love spreads, like that."]],[3298,["It does not rest in one place."]],[3301,["It does not stagnate, it does not coagulate."]],[3307,["Supposing in a plant, sap is rising and it","goes to one flower because it loves it, and"]],[3314,["settles down there."]],[3315,["The tree will die and the flower will die."]],[3317,["So the love we have before Realisation, is","like that love, which dies ultimately or creates"]],[3324,["problems and it dies."]],[3326,["But love after Realisation is a love that","emits, just flows."]],[3330,["You don’t get anything."]],[3331,["“What do you get?”"]],[3333,["people ask me."]],[3334,["I mean my husband is in a different line and","I have a double life, and all my friends ask,"]],[3340,["“What do you get out of it?”"]],[3342,["I say, “I am not here to get."]],[3344,["I get out something from me."]],[3346,["It’s just to give, is to enjoy.\""]],[3349,["As I told your mayor today, “Your politics","will be solved."]],[3352,["You’ll have no parties.\""]],[3353,["He said, “How can that be?”"]],[3354,["I said, “See now: I have supposing all the","powers, so I am a capitalist."]],[3361,["But I must share, so I’m a communist."]],[3363,["I have to be a pure communist and a pure capitalist."]],[3367,["So how can I have two parties when both the","things exist within me?”"]],[3373,["That’s how you solve your politics."]],[3374,["How do you solve your economics?"]],[3375,["The whole transaction areas and all those","things come from a false idea that matter"]],[3381,["can give us happiness: it cannot."]],[3384,["Only the matter that has a certain coefficience,","which gives vibrations, is the only thing"]],[3390,["that gives you joy."]],[3391,["Now we don’t know if there is such matter","around."]],[3394,["For example somebody will say Stonehenge."]],[3397,["I mean, it looks funny with the druids."]],[3399,["Of course they don’t know anything, I agree."]],[3401,["But it is not [funny], because Stonehenge","is created by the Mother Earth."]],[3407,["It has vibrations."]],[3408,["They can’t feel anything, they are standing","there, singing songs, this, that."]],[3413,["Somebody must have felt in their forefathers."]],[3415,["There are many places where you get vibrations","from the Mother Earth, so many."]],[3422,["It is written in the Bible, in the ten commandments,","only that whatever is created by the Mother"]],[3427,["Earth or by the sky should not be reproduced","by human beings and worshipped."]],[3432,["But there are many things which have come","out of the Mother Earth."]],[3437,["But unless and until you have vibrations,","how will you know?"]],[3440,["You don’t know the truth."]],[3441,["So in the human awareness, to know the truth,","is very relative."]],[3445,["You will say that, “How is it that this","person is fake and that person is not fake?”"]],[3450,["“This is truth that is not truth?”"]],[3452,["There’s no way of knowing it."]],[3453,["Unless and until you get to the Absolute point,","how will you know the relative?"]],[3457,["So when you get your Realisation, you can","ask, “Is he a real man?”"]],[3460,["If he is, you will get vibrations."]],[3465,["If he’s not, then, you might even get blisters;","vibrations will stop maybe; little bit blisters"]],[3473,["you might get, if he is not a right type of","a person."]],[3476,["If somebody is obstinate, you will get indication."]],[3479,["If somebody is suffering from some possession,","you will get indication."]],[3483,["If somebody is mentally mad, you will know."]],[3486,["It’s very, very systematic, and very scientific."]],[3491,["God’s laws never fail, [are] very attentive,","and everything that you know through it is"]],[3498,["absolute and correct."]],[3499,["Only thing is you have to learn: you have","to train up your mind to understand these"]],[3504,["different things."]],[3505,["But small children are much cleverer than","bigger people; because you see, they have"]],[3511,["so many hangups, they have so many complications,","they rationalise everything."]],[3516,["Children will just say this: “This is this!”"]],[3521,["Now people think that, “How can it be free?”"]],[3526,["How can it be with money?"]],[3530,["I ask the other question!"]],[3532,["We cannot think of these things in the terms","that I’d say [is] Divine, because you have"]],[3537,["never known it before."]],[3539,["How much money did Christ get?"]],[3542,["We have a life here of Christ: how much money","did he take?"]],[3548,["Now Christianity as such — they asked me","a question today — I mean it cannot deliver"]],[3552,["the goods!"]],[3553,["They are Christians, they go to church, but","is their life Christian?"]],[3561,["Churches cannot deliver the goods."]],[3563,["But that doesn’t mean that you run away","from Christ."]],[3566,["You can run away from that kind of things,","but not from Christ, because Christ exists."]],[3571,["He definitely exists within us, and is a special","person because he’s placed at a very pivotal"]],[3577,["point, between the centre of the optic chiasma,","where the pituitary and pineal body are there"]],[3593,["and he controls our ego and superego."]],[3596,["And when the Kundalini rises, then Christ","is awakened, and he sucks all of our karmas,"]],[3600,["all of our sins."]],[3602,["That’s what he said — that he has suffered","for our sins."]],[3605,["They will say Christ, in the church they say","it, and then why do they ask you to suffer?"]],[3611,["If Christ has suffered, why should we suffer","anymore?"]],[3615,["There should be no sufferings anymore, just","enjoy and rejoice."]],[3618,["He’s done everything for us."]],[3620,["Or do you want him to suffer more?"]],[3622,["There are Jews who said, that, “We don’t","believe in Christ, and we have to suffer.\""]],[3628,["Already, “Have Mr Hitler for you!”"]],[3630,["If they want another one, they can have another","one."]],[3633,["And go on with your suffering."]],[3635,["It is high time that they accept Christ and","give up their sufferings, otherwise, they"]],[3639,["are putting their sufferings on other people."]],[3642,["There is no suffering needed anymore."]],[3645,["It’s a funny idea, I don’t understand,","why people say you must suffer to become spiritual?"]],[3651,["Who has given you these ideas?"]],[3654,["Actually among Hindus it was believed that,","our karmas, we have to pay for it."]],[3661,["Yes, all right."]],[3662,["Up to what point?"]],[3664,["Till somebody called Mahavishnu comes in:","that is Christ."]],[3669,["He’s called as ‘Mahavishnu’."]],[3670,["All the signs and symptoms of Christ are described","as Mahavishnu in the Devi Mahatmyam, but who"]],[3677,["reads that?"]],[3678,["I mean Christians will only read Bible!"]],[3679,["Will they read something else?"]],[3682,["So they never knew."]],[3683,["And when the missionaries went from here,","they never talked about Christ like that."]],[3687,["“Oh,” they just said, “you’d better","get converted.\""]],[3689,["They used to brand everyone: Christian, Christian,","Christian, Christian."]],[3692,["They would put a loaf of bread in the water,","and say that, “This is the beef, and all"]],[3698,["of you have become now Christians!”"]],[3700,["So by villages they became Christians."]],[3701,["Imagine this kind of a Christianity, how far","is it going to go?"]],[3705,["They never said that Christ is the one who","was Mahavishnu because they never knew."]],[3710,["Until I told them that it was he, the Mahavishnu","who came, who has come already."]],[3716,["And he is going to suck our [karmas]."]],[3718,["So this is done, then what?"]],[3720,["Why to worry about karmas?"]],[3721,["[They are] finished!"]],[3722,["All our karmas are over."]],[3724,["But here we have Christ, but we don’t know","his essence."]],[3728,["We don’t know what is he there for, what","was the need for him to crucify himself."]],[3733,["It was just to create a tremendous Deity within","us, that is Christ, who will suck our up our"]],[3741,["[bad] vibrations."]],[3742,["Now we have many Jews who are our disciples."]],[3744,["They will jolly well have to accept Christ,","because Kundalini does not rise unless and"]],[3748,["until you accept it here."]],[3749,["But even those Christians who don’t accept,","say Moses, or Jehovah: they have to accept"]],[3754,["that Jehovah is sitting here (above Agnya)."]],[3759,["That’s the Viraata."]],[3761,["That’s the Akbar: that, you have to see","for yourself when the Kundalini rises."]],[3766,["You’ll be amazed, unless and until you say","Lord’s prayer, it won’t rise above this"]],[3771,["(Agnya), if it is stuck there."]],[3773,["And all the Christians have this problem."]],[3775,["You will be surprised that Christ himself","is angry with them."]],[3780,["You have to say Lord’s prayer."]],[3782,["That’s why he said, “You will be calling","me ‘Christ, Christ,’ and I won’t recognise"]],[3786,["[you].\""]],[3787,["Just imagine!"]],[3790,["Then you have to say Lord’s prayer in front","of some holy personality [so that] he forgives"]],[3797,["you, and then the Kundalini rises."]],[3802,["Just imagine — he was the one who was the","controller of ego, he is the one who sucks"]],[3807,["our ego, and see the Christian nations: if","there is one thing they cannot get out is"]],[3813,["their ego."]],[3814,["Now they are realising it, no doubt."]],[3815,["But still to get out of it, they have to fight","it; and the more you fight it, it becomes"]],[3819,["like a balloon — big, big, big, big, big."]],[3822,["But by fighting it you cannot get out of it."]],[3825,["Only by rising through the central path you","can suck it, through the awakening of Christ,"]],[3832,["and you get your Realisation as cool breeze","coming out of your head."]],[3836,["But when it happens also, as I said, people","do not know what it is — these Brahma Shakti"]],[3844,["or what you call this cool breeze of the Holy","Ghost, what it is, because they didn’t allow"]],[3849,["Christ to live long."]],[3850,["He lived for hardly three and a half years","to talk about it."]],[3853,["I mean the way they treated him was really","so atrocious and so cruel."]],[3859,["To whom could he talk, to these fishermen?"]],[3865,["About Kundalini?"]],[3866,["I mean they made it impossible!"]],[3868,["Same with Mohammed Sahib: Arabs could not","accept Mohammed at all."]],[3873,["And they have not yet accepted him, the way","they are crucifying him everyday."]],[3879,["He couldn’t tell people about it."]],[3881,["But he did promise that it will happen to","you."]],[3886,["He’s promised that a Comforter will come,","so that you will know my Father forever — means"]],[3892,["you will get your Self-Realisation."]],[3893,["He promised it."]],[3895,["But how will you make him out?"]],[3896,["How will you make out the Comforter?"]],[3898,["How will you find out, if Christ comes in?"]],[3900,["Now some ‘christ’ is being announced."]],[3903,["It’s a big joke."]],[3904,["You’d better tell this ‘Mr Christ’ to","walk on the water."]],[3908,["And you’ll find him out!"]],[3910,["We had one in India."]],[3912,["He told that he is going to walk on the water."]],[3915,["And mad people from America, they came with","televisions, telescopes, and all Indians were"]],[3919,["there to see the fun of the whole thing."]],[3922,["All of them came here and Government also","encouraged people because lots of foreign"]],[3926,["exchange, you know, for this kind of tomfoolery!"]],[3929,["They all came, they occupied premises in a","very big hotel, where there was a huge big"]],[3937,["swimming bath, where this fellow was supposed","to walk on the water."]],[3943,["And they had telescopes and every sort of","thing there."]],[3947,["And apart from that they had a television","set, and from America they were going to release"]],[3952,["all the scenes of what was going to happen."]],[3956,["This fellow came forward, it was on the television,","you could see it."]],[3959,["He put one foot, and with the second foot","he was down!"]],[3962,["(laughter) He couldn’t even swim!"]],[3963,["Can you imagine?"]],[3964,["And they had to fish him out!"]],[3967,["And he was put in the hospital, and they found","he had cancer."]],[3977,["But imagine, when they asked, “Why did you","do all this?”"]],[3980,["He said, “At least I got a name!”"]],[3984,["Imagine!"]],[3985,["Like some hijackers, they say that, “At","least by doing these things, we will get some"]],[3987,["name.\""]],[3988,["You know there are some maniacs who want to","appear in the newspaper this way or that way."]],[3992,["So he said, “I got a big name, in America."]],[3995,["Everywhere, everyone knows me!”"]],[3996,["Thank God he’s no more now to befool some."]],[3999,["You see these tricks they play."]],[4001,["So these tricks have nothing to do with God."]],[4004,["If he’s Christ, let him walk on the water!"]],[4007,["If you people will be kind enough, you better","write to this gentleman who has spent so much"]],[4011,["money in the newspapers, especially to the","journalists I would request."]],[4016,["Because journalism takes to such stupid people","very easily, I don’t know why."]],[4019,["They will publish."]],[4020,["You know they published such a lot of things","about this nonsensical ‘christ’ who has"]],[4024,["come."]],[4025,["Better ask him."]],[4026,["There’s another one who was trying to teach","flying."]],[4030,["Poor things who were flying, one of them is","sitting here, she was the directress of the"]],[4036,["institution, got epilepsy, the husband got","epilepsy, the child got epilepsy, all of them."]],[4040,["They lost all their money, all their property,","everything."]],[4044,["That’s how they were flying on the streets","of London."]],[4048,["I said, “Why not ask the guru to fly?"]],[4049,["Why not use these leaning tower of Pisa?"]],[4053,["Just throw him down."]],[4054,["Let’s see how far he can fly!”"]],[4055,["And then they were paying £3,000 to learn","flying nonsense!"]],[4057,["Why do you want to fly?"]],[4060,["Are you going to become birds now?"]],[4066,["Like these nonsensical tricks they play on","you, and you believe them."]],[4073,["It is never said in any scripture, any books,","anywhere that you will be flying as religious"]],[4082,["people or as spiritual people — never!"]],[4086,["Nor that you will be becoming mad."]],[4090,["Even ‘St’ Paul who was — I don’t know","how they included him in the Bible — I can’t"]],[4095,["understand how was he a Christian?"]],[4097,["This is first thing."]],[4098,["If he saw the light, well and good."]],[4099,["Who saw the light?"]],[4101,["Now supposing you go and say, “I have seen","the light, and I have become a great Christian!”"]],[4106,["and you start organising it, must you be included","in Bible?"]],[4111,["He has no idea of Christ, and he has no idea","of reality!"]],[4114,["When I saw him [in The Bible] I said, “From","where does this gentleman come in?”"]],[4118,["He was nowhere near reality and he said, that","people got like mad when Holy Ghost came,"]],[4126,["everybody started laughing and they started","saying all kinds of words and all kinds of"]],[4132,["languages."]],[4133,["It’s very easy."]],[4136,["You see, say if an Indian possesses you, you","will start behaving just like an Indian: you’ll"]],[4141,["speak Indian language, you may be thieving,","telling lies — all these things which are"]],[4146,["their character."]],[4147,["Or if you are an English man entered into","an Indian, you will start speaking Oxbridge"]],[4152,["English."]],[4153,["It’s possible — you have seen these things","happening to people when they get possessed,"]],[4159,["they do it."]],[4161,["It’s all possession."]],[4162,["What is the way to know what you have got?"]],[4165,["It’s so much unknown that, anything that","is unknown is not God!"]],[4171,["There is collective subconscious, and there","is collective supraconscious."]],[4176,["Anybody can enter in from that area and can","possess us."]],[4179,["You must have seen a film shown by some doctors","who said that cancer is caused by some proteins"]],[4187,["— proteins which come to us from the areas","which are built within us since the time of"]],[4194,["our creation — that’s collective subconscious."]],[4197,["They say it clearly — protein 58 to protein","52."]],[4202,["They say it so clearly about it that, that","is what triggers our cancer."]],[4209,["But they don’t know how to control them."]],[4210,["Of course, I have been saying this for the","last twelve years!"]],[4213,["But nobody understood at that time when I","was saying that it is the collective subconscious"]],[4217,["from where these things come in."]],[4220,["Christ is the one who took out [dead] spirits","and put in the pigs."]],[4225,["And here they are talking of Christian movements","like you have got Pentecostals and charismatic"]],[4230,["and this and that, where they are putting","spirits into you!"]],[4233,["And when they come before me, they shake like","this — just like this — and go into an"]],[4239,["epileptic mood."]],[4240,["I sometimes you see there are a hundred spirits","sitting in those people."]],[4243,["They have no idea as to what to do with the","dead, they are so naïve."]],[4247,["In the church you are sitting on a dead body","— God knows how many."]],[4252,["They don’t know how to do that."]],[4255,["For example if an Indian lady from India comes","in, she walks like this, saving her feet,"]],[4260,["“Oh God, they are sleeping here!”"]],[4262,["We know that when they are buried there, maybe","their dead souls are around."]],[4269,["But here in the church you go: I mean [it’s]","a very nice way of possessing a person!"]],[4274,["There’s a Sahaja Yogini in Paris: her mother","was about sixty years of age — not very"]],[4282,["old because I am of that age — and she was","so mad, she became so mad, that she did not"]],[4287,["know what was a bidet and what was a WC."]],[4289,["And she was a funny woman, and she sometimes","used to forget even her daughter!"]],[4297,["But Sunday morning she would get up in a very","normal way, dress up very well, go to the"]],[4304,["church, say her prayers and come back."]],[4307,["I mean, like a possessed person, she used","to walk."]],[4310,["But somehow one of the Sundays she got lost","and she informed the police."]],[4314,["The police said, “You better send her to","one of these places where the old are looked"]],[4319,["after.\""]],[4320,["So this Marie told me that, when they put","her there, she found there are many like this"]],[4326,["who get up on Sundays!"]],[4327,["There is a church for them."]],[4329,["Also there are dead bodies of these mad women."]],[4332,["They go to this church every Sunday, again","they are mad for the whole week, again on"]],[4337,["the Sunday, they get up and go to the church","and come back."]],[4341,["Just imagine!"]],[4343,["How can that be God?"]],[4345,["You mean these dead spirits are God?"]],[4347,["And will He shake you all the time like this,","if God enters into you?"]],[4351,["How can it be?"]],[4354,["It’s maddening."]],[4355,["Will you become more dignified and beautiful,","or you will become ridiculous?"]],[4361,["Just ask a question to yourself?"]],[4362,["In the Bible, it is written that everybody","said that these people are possessed, and"]],[4367,["they laughed at them, and they said they have","gone mad."]],[4369,["And still it is in the Bible, and people read","it!"]],[4372,["“Let us read chapter this…”"]],[4374,["Just imagine describing mad people!"]],[4377,["And that has become ‘authentic’, now who","is going to challenge them?"]],[4378,["They’ll kill me if I tell them that, but","it’s a fact."]],[4379,["This is not what is going to happen to you."]],[4387,["What Christ has said [is] “Your hands will","speak.\""]],[4391,["Even Mohammed Sahib has said more about the","day of resurrection."]],[4396,["He didn’t talk of the day of death first,","of the complete destruction first, he talked"]],[4404,["more about the day of resurrection."]],[4406,["Christ also [about] the day of judgement."]],[4407,["They did not talk of the death."]],[4410,["While there are people sitting around and","thinking, “Now when will that day come when"]],[4417,["we’ll all be finished?”"]],[4419,["Imagine!"]],[4420,["We have reached that state of confusion that","we are waiting for a complete destruction,"]],[4424,["trying to celebrate it, the way people are","anxious about it."]],[4428,["First of all, you all have to enter into the","Kingdom of God – that’s the place for"]],[4433,["you."]],[4434,["That’s the place to enjoy."]],[4435,["That’s the place God has made."]],[4437,["He has not made you a human being to suffer","and suffer and die in suffering, then we have"]],[4445,["never understood Him."]],[4447,["He is the Father of compassion."]],[4449,["He is the ocean of love, an ocean of forgiveness."]],[4454,["We have forgotten, what His nature is."]],[4458,["And we really misunderstand that he has made","us to suffer."]],[4462,["This is really absolutely [an] anti-God idea,","I think, and I just can’t understand how"]],[4467,["can we really gulp it down."]],[4469,["It’s too much, to believe that God will","make you suffer."]],[4474,["Or [that] Kundalini makes you suffer is another","worse idea."]],[4476,["She is your Mother."]],[4478,["She has been with you."]],[4479,["She has been waiting."]],[4480,["She is your own mother."]],[4482,["Everybody has an individual Mother."]],[4483,["She has been waiting for this day to give","you Realisation, is she going to make you"]],[4492,["suffer?"]],[4493,["May God bless you all."]],[4494,["I’m very happy to be back, and I hope you’ll","have more people next time and I’ll be able"]],[4497,["to come back again."]],[4499,["If you have any problems, any questions, you","may ask me."]],[4513,["Seeker: You said on the radio interview today,","that you were destined to become what you"]],[4521,["are today."]],[4524,["Are we also destined?"]],[4527,["Shri Mataji: You have hit the point."]],[4529,["That’s it!"]],[4531,["Absolutely, that’s it!"]],[4533,["You are all destined to come and get Realisation","— absolutely that’s it!"]],[4536,["Otherwise, do you think am I mad to go about?"]],[4544,["Have you ever known so many seekers in this","world?"]],[4548,["Not only destined, but [with] deliberations."]],[4551,["You have deliberately taken birth in those","days to get your Realisation, and to do the"]],[4560,["work of God, and to enjoy the bliss of God."]],[4567,["It’s a deliberate action on your part."]],[4570,["Destination is of course there, but deliberations","are there [too]."]],[4573,["You have to be all very special people to","do that, no doubt."]],[4580,["That’s a quality, that’s a quality: everybody","doesn’t have that quality."]],[4586,["That’s a quality of people, and only such","people can stick on."]],[4589,["I couldn’t tell this to our mayor, that","it’s a quality that is lacking."]],[4596,["It’s a quality."]],[4598,["They just know that — this is the truth."]],[4602,["Seeker: Isn’t possible to abuse the Kundalini?"]],[4603,["Shri Mataji: No, never, never, never, never!"]],[4606,["You cannot, never."]],[4607,["Seeker: But can you awaken it through the","wrong channel?"]],[4608,["Shri Mataji: You cannot do it."]],[4609,["You cannot do it."]],[4612,["You just cannot."]],[4613,["It’s the wisdom."]],[4615,["Kundalini is awakened only by the permission","of a Deity which is wisdom."]],[4620,["You can never misuse it."]],[4623,["You can never sell it."]],[4624,["I’ll give you an example."]],[4627,["There was a gentleman, an Indian, whom I gave","Realisation in America, who started his own"]],[4634,["organisation."]],[4635,["As usual Indians are very good at making money."]],[4637,["Put them anywhere, they’ll make money."]],[4640,["This fellow, first he behaved all right, and","then he started his organisation and all that"]],[4644,["and he wrote to me, “I am doing this Sahaja","Yoga, I am doing this, and I’ve got lots"]],[4647,["of people coming.\""]],[4648,["He put a fees and all that."]],[4650,["I didn’t know how he was running it."]],[4652,["Of course, you can charge for the food all","right, you can charge for your stay."]],[4655,["But when he came — the people in Bombay","are very sensitive — they told me, “Mother,"]],[4660,["we are fainting with this man!"]],[4661,["What’s the matter with him?"]],[4662,["We are all feeling giddy.\""]],[4663,["I said, “Don’t you worry."]],[4665,["I’ll find out.\""]],[4666,["When he came, I said, “Can I have a look","at your brochure?”"]],[4670,["In the brochure, he had written, “For vibrations,","ordinary, $125."]],[4674,["For special ones $280!”"]],[4675,["I said, “Sir why this?”"]],[4676,["He said, “Mother how am I to live?”"]],[4677,["I said, “What were you doing?”"]],[4680,["He said, “I was a teacher.\""]],[4683,["I said, “You go ahead with your teaching."]],[4688,["How much money did you pay me to get your","vibrations that you put this kind of a thing"]],[4692,["there?”"]],[4693,["He said, “But how am I going to live?”"]],[4695,["And he got into a temper, and he became very","red."]],[4697,["Now, “I can talk to you about it."]],[4700,["You cannot take any money for it.\""]],[4703,["So he got very angry."]],[4704,["He said, “I am going to see one Guru.\""]],[4706,["I said, “Go and see him!”"]],[4708,["This is a guru living in Calicut (Kozhikode)."]],[4710,["Actually I have never met him."]],[4713,["But this fellow, when he came back, he telephoned","to me."]],[4716,["He said, “Mother please forgive me, please","forgive me, please forgive me.\""]],[4719,["I said, “What happened?”"]],[4720,["He telephoned, and on the telephone he said,","“I must tell you all of what happened.\""]],[4725,["I said, “What happened?”"]],[4726,["He said, “I went there, and when I reached","the gate, this guru was sitting in a hut,"]],[4730,["and he started throwing stones at me: one","after another, so many stones he threw that"]],[4734,["I just sat down there."]],[4736,["He said, “What do you mean?"]],[4738,["You have said those things to Mother and you","think I will give you some blessings here?"]],[4743,["These are my blessings, go ahead!”"]],[4745,["And poor fellow, he went back: he went and","sat in the station, on the platform."]],[4753,["And one of this guru’s persons went and","said that, “What did you say to Mother?"]],[4758,["He knows that Mother is there, and how dare","you say something to Mother?”"]],[4762,["He said, “Because I was making money and","she was angry with me, and this.\""]],[4766,["He said, “You better go and ask for forgiveness!”"]],[4769,["For three days, he stayed on the platform","and on the fourth day the guru sent for him"]],[4774,["[and] he came."]],[4775,["And then he said a Sanskrit shloka in my praise","and all that."]],[4778,["He said, “Just go and read it out to Mother,","that’s all.\""]],[4779,["So he brought that and read it on the phone."]],[4783,["But somehow he could not meet me."]],[4786,["He tried his level best but he just could","not meet me."]],[4789,["And he read that to me."]],[4791,["But when this guru, I told him that, “Why","don’t you go to America, because this year"]],[4794,["I won’t be able to go?”"]],[4796,["He went to New York, he was there for three","days and he went back."]],[4799,["He said, “They are all mad people!"]],[4801,["They are dollar-mad!"]],[4802,["I can’t stay there."]],[4803,["They were offering me dollars for everything.\""]],[4804,["So he ran back!"]],[4805,["He couldn’t stay there."]],[4806,["So there are realised-souls."]],[4808,["There are people who know about Sahaja Yoga."]],[4811,["But they know that you cannot sell it."]],[4814,["If you try to do anything like that — finished","— you will lose your vibrations immediately."]],[4820,["They are very sensitive, very sensitive."]],[4824,["If you are ignorant, then it’s all right,","they will stay."]],[4829,["But knowingly if you do something, just they’ll","disappear."]],[4831,["And you won’t like it, because when they","are flowing you are enjoying yourself, and"]],[4835,["you just stop [enjoying]."]],[4838,["Those who don’t know anything about Kundalini,","they say the Kundalini is in the stomach,"]],[4850,["this, that — they are not authorised people,","they try to play tricks with Kundalini — they"]],[4853,["get into trouble."]],[4854,["Because it’s not the Kundalini, because","She is the Mother, but the Deity, the Deity"]],[4859,["that is Christ actually in another form called","Ganesha is sitting down there."]],[4863,["He hits them hard onto the sympathetic, and","that’s how they get it, all the problems."]],[4868,["Seeker: So how do other gurus raise the Kundalini?"]],[4872,["Shri Mataji: That’s what I am going to do."]],[4875,["Once I have done it, then you will do."]],[4877,["First an enlightened light must enlighten","you."]],[4880,["Once you are enlightened, you enlighten other","people."]],[4883,["Dr Warren: He said, how do other gurus raise","the Kundalini?"]],[4889,["Shri Mataji: Which one?"]],[4892,["Which one?"]],[4893,["Let’s have him out."]],[4895,["I will send half of them to them."]],[4898,["Who is the one?"]],[4899,["They just talk."]],[4901,["Seeker: Swami Muktananda is quite popular."]],[4904,["Shri Mataji: You think he’s raising Kundalini","or he’s putting bhoots?"]],[4907,["He is putting possessions!"]],[4909,["They just dance, dance, dance."]],[4911,["Anybody can dance, what is so great?"]],[4914,["Anybody can dance, what is there so great","in dancing?"]],[4918,["Is there?"]],[4920,["But Kundalini you can see with your naked","eyes, the pulsation, the rising and the cool"]],[4924,["breeze coming out of your head."]],[4927,["That’s what it is."]],[4928,["It’s not dancing: even Rajneesh does that!"]],[4930,["He even takes out your clothes!"]],[4931,["All right?"]],[4932,["But this Muktanand is a funny fellow I must","say."]],[4937,["Horrible fellow he spoils the Kundalini so","badly!"]],[4944,["The other day one fellow came, who was with","him for sixteen years, can you imagine?"]],[4946,["He’s good for nothing now!"]],[4948,["How to give him Realisation?"]],[4951,["He’s spent all his money, everything."]],[4953,["He has become so useless."]],[4954,["And then he says now, “Now I feel I am mentally","also good for nothing.\""]],[4958,["I sent him to Australia, that fellow."]],[4963,["I am sorry!"]],[4964,["I didn’t mean you, I did not mean you."]],[4966,["I sent him to Australia because he was going","to Australia, I said all right, you go and"]],[4969,["see these people."]],[4970,["But a headache, I tell you."]],[4972,["He’s good for nothing, this fellow!"]],[4975,["I know his names in his previous lives (Muktanand)."]],[4979,["But very difficult."]],[4980,["Horrible!"]],[4981,["They","not only want to make money: it’s all right,"]],[4989,["there are thugs, there are smugglers, all","right, I don’t mind."]],[4992,["But they’ll spoil your chances of Realisation."]],[4994,["They are anti-God."]],[4996,["That’s the point is!"]],[4999,["The Kundalini just doesn’t rise in people","who go to Muktanand — rather difficult."]],[5000,["Don’t be frightened, if you have been, I’ll","manage it."]],[5005,["It can be worked out."]],[5008,["But when you will meet somebody Muktanandi,","you will know: you will run away from that"]],[5014,["person then, because the hands break!"]],[5016,["You get tired."]],[5017,["The Kundalini is tired, poor thing: She hits","her head, this side, that side."]],[5021,["I don’t know what he does: horrible, cruel","man."]],[5031,["One better than the other, this Muktanand."]],[5036,["Can’t you see on his face?"]],[5040,["What does he talk?"]],[5041,["All nonsense!"]],[5042,["Very easy to make out."]],[5044,["He puts the Kundalini in such a way that the","Void is completely finished!"]],[5049,["The crossing point, that Void, is so much","obstructed that the Kundalini doesn’t get"]],[5054,["out of that, it just wobbles there only."]],[5057,["Well, we’ll work it out, all right?"]],[5062,["We’ll work it out."]],[5065,["You are seekers, you are seekers."]],[5070,["You are God’s own people."]],[5073,["And you are to be saved."]],[5075,["So let these horrible people delude you."]],[5076,["How long will they go on?"]],[5077,["All of them have to perish one by one, you","will see that."]],[5079,["The best part of it [is] that all untruth","fails, ultimately."]],[5085,["Seeker: How do you actually tell a true guru?"]],[5090,["Shri Mataji: After Realisation it’s very","easy."]],[5093,["But you can tell."]],[5095,["For example, can’t you say who is a sincere","person?"]],[5098,["You can, if you don’t get into the circus."]],[5102,["It’s simple."]],[5103,["But a true guru will not be worried about","your purse, as to how much money you have"]],[5113,["got."]],[5114,["And he will give you your own powers."]],[5115,["He’ll not try to show off his own powers,","talk about his own powers, “I am this, I"]],[5121,["am that,” nothing."]],[5122,["Unless and until the Kundalini is risen and","you have got Self-realisation, nobody will"]],[5126,["give you false certificate that Kundalini","is awakened."]],[5130,["It has to manifested."]],[5132,["It’s all falsehood: [from] a to z, it is","false."]],[5137,["Supposing for example that somebody’s Kundalini","doesn’t rise — all right, it does not"]],[5140,["rise."]],[5141,["My own daughters are not realised-souls, what","can I do about it?"]],[5145,["My own daughters are not realised-souls."]],[5147,["But my grandchildren are."]],[5149,["So what can I do?"]],[5151,["I cannot force on them."]],[5153,["If it is not, it is not."]],[5158,["You cannot give a false certificate."]],[5159,["It has to happen."]],[5165,["Seeker: Isn’t it hard to combine Christian","and Hindu concepts?"]],[5170,["Shri Mataji: No, no, it is the easiest."]],[5171,["They are just the same, my child."]],[5172,["They are just the same."]],[5174,["There is no difference at all."]],[5176,["They are all one."]],[5178,["Christ has said, “Those who are not against","me are with me.\""]],[5184,["Who are they?"]],[5187,["They are all one."]],[5189,["There is no difference at all."]],[5191,["You’ll find it."]],[5192,["At different stages they came on this Earth","to give us a new dimension, all of them."]],[5198,["Like on a tree, we have different flowers","at different times, but they all come from"]],[5203,["the same source, don’t they?"]],[5205,["Now they pluck the flower, “This is my flower,”","“This is my flower.\""]],[5208,["That’s not, that’s a dead flower."]],[5213,["The same energy produces the same flowers."]],[5217,["But they fight."]],[5219,["You will be surprised, if I tell you the whole","history of the relationship between them:"]],[5227,["between Christ and Krishna, between Mohammed","and Christ, and Krishna, there’s a big relationship."]],[5236,["They are all related to each other, very closely,","which you’ll find out in Kundalini also."]],[5245,["It’s very interesting how they are related,","now they have played the game."]],[5250,["And they are all settled down within us: all","brothers sisters, husband-wife; all sorts"]],[5254,["of relationship they have."]],[5255,["It’s very interesting to see, but it is","not only a story but you can see it yourself,"]],[5262,["that they are within you."]],[5266,["Say for example if I say that Mohammed Sahib","was the same as Nanak, Guru Nanak."]],[5274,["Imagine the Sikhs are breaking the neck of","Muslims, and Muslims are breaking the heads"]],[5276,["of the Sikhs."]],[5279,["It’s a big quarrel going on."]],[5286,["But Nanak came after Mohammed, to teach Muslim-Hindu","unity."]],[5294,["Because he was surprised the way Muslims are."]],[5297,["But they are one!"]],[5301,["They are one personality, born again and again."]],[5305,["Moses, Abraham, Socrates: all of them are","the same."]],[5310,["Now if a Muslim is a fanatic, he gets a cancer."]],[5317,["Normally he should, or he becomes a dry personality."]],[5321,["Imagine Khomeini."]],[5323,["They become a dry personality."]],[5325,["They can be very violent people."]],[5328,["But supposing they get into trouble, like","cancer."]],[5330,["I had one Muslim coming from Iran, who was","a fanatic, he got cancer."]],[5336,["I said, “You think that Mohammed Sahib is","the only person?”"]],[5340,["“Yes,” he said."]],[5341,["“But if I say, Guru Nanak was the same.\""]],[5344,["“I can’t believe it.\""]],[5345,["I said, “Then I can’t cure you."]],[5346,["You have to accept, because Mohammed Sahib","himself is against you, because he came in"]],[5350,["ten forms.\""]],[5351,["And he wouldn’t accept it."]],[5353,["But his wife prevailed upon him because he","was very sick."]],[5357,["And he got cured."]],[5359,["That’s how you have to prove."]],[5362,["Human beings cannot easily understand."]],[5363,["You see, if you are born in a Christian religion,","you become a Christian."]],[5368,["It’s a horrible thing like that!"]],[5371,["You are all human beings, and all this people","have come on this Earth to give you a new"]],[5377,["dimension."]],[5378,["Only we don’t understand them."]],[5381,["They never came to make us fanatics."]],[5383,["That at least ,that is too much to see."]],[5389,["After Realisation, you will know that they","are all in complete unison, complete concord,"]],[5394,["that’s not possible on human level: absolute","complete concord."]],[5399,["Yes, it’s a fact!"]],[5402,["All right, should we have Realisation now,","let us try."]],[5408,["Because I have to go now to London, and tomorrow","is another very heavy day."]],[5415,["Please put your hands."]]]);
